# Internal working docs. docs/ is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT — anything dropped in it
# stays local unless explicitly re-included below. Only two things are published:
#   docs/guide.md   — linked from README.md
#   docs/wiki/      — read by scripts/wiki-check.mjs (CI gate), linked from
#                     README.md and AGENTS.md as the agent instruction layer
docs/*
!docs/guide.md
!docs/wiki/

# Design context for the `impeccable` skill. Must sit at the repo root because
# its loader resolves ONE directory and cwd wins — but it is working material,
# not published output. Ignored here, still on disk, still loaded.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
